  "description": "<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Join the <strong>GT Affiliate Program</strong> and partner with a brand that's redefining style, quality, and elegance. GT offers timeless, high-quality fashion that&rsquo;s built to last, with a collection designed for every occasion&mdash;whether it&rsquo;s everyday essentials or bold statement pieces. Share GT with your audience and start earning today!</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Why Promote GT?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<li><strong>Timeless, Investment-Worthy Pieces</strong>: GT offers carefully curated designs that transcend trends, giving your audience fashion that lasts for years.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Premium Quality</strong>: Our pieces are crafted from high-quality materials, ensuring style, comfort, and durability.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Inclusive Sizing</strong>: Fashion for every body type, with a wide range of sizes to ensure everyone feels fabulous.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Generous Commissions</strong>: Earn competitive commissions on every sale you drive to GT.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Easy-to-Use Tools</strong>: Get access to affiliate links, banners, and promotional assets to make sharing GT effortless.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>GT Product Description</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">GT is a fashion brand that combines timeless elegance with modern sensibility. Each piece is designed with premium materials and attention to detail, ensuring versatility, quality, and longevity. From everyday basics to standout items, GT is all about fashion that feels good and lasts.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Unique Selling Proposition (USP)</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">GT isn&rsquo;t just about keeping up with the latest trends; it&rsquo;s about investing in fashion that stands the test of time. Our pieces are designed to be versatile and durable, offering a perfect balance of style, comfort, and quality. Whether you're building a wardrobe of essentials or adding distinctive statement pieces, GT delivers value and timeless appeal.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Payment Conditions</strong></h3>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Commission Structure</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For <strong>sales up to &pound;1,000</strong>, affiliates will earn a <strong>10% commission</strong> on the total sales generated.</li>\r\n<li>For <strong>sales over &pound;1,000</strong>, affiliates will earn a <strong>12% commission</strong> on the total sales generated.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Schedule</strong>: Payments will be made on a <strong>monthly basis</strong> for all commissions earned during the previous month.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Method</strong>: Payments will be processed via <strong>bank transfer</strong> and are typically issued within <strong>7-10 business days</strong> after the end of each month.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
